        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>RK International CP-3711, Traditional Cabinet Pull</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nBeautifully simple, the Smooth Decorative Bow Pull chicness comes from is sleek design. A lot of times, only modern-styled hardware is as sleek as this one, and that makes this traditional cabinet pull all the more special. It has a 3 inch center to center. Available in 5 finishes.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications and Features</b> of the RK International CP-3711 3\" Smooth Decorative Bow Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Brass</li>\r\n<li>Length c.c. (center to center): 3\"</li>\r\n<li>Overall Length: 3-7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Screw: 1\" long #8 - 32 machine screw.</li>\r\n<li>Packaged with all necessary installation hardware.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/MUL-T-LOCK-G55G1_size.gif?v=1704354738\" width=\"600\" height=\"146\" border=\"0\" alt=\"RKI Finishes Diagram\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
